      "prompt": [
        "The reports team wants the stored orders listed **by id**, not by arrival. Because the program only talks to `IRepository<Order>`, you can swap the whole store without touching any caller.",
        "",
        "Write `class SortedRepository<T> : IRepository<T> where T : IEntity`, backed by a `SortedDictionary<int, T>`, with the same duplicate rule. Then change **only** the line that creates the store to `new SortedRepository<Order>()`. Keep `ListRepository<T>` in the file; nothing else changes.",
        "For this input:",
        "",
        "```text",
        "7,bob,gadget,1",
        "1,alice,widget,3",
        "1,carol,widget,2",
        "3,dave,widget,2",
        "3,mallory,widget,1",
